  * ci: the trigger gate on every pull request, red
  * ci: each cell uploads its own fuzz-findings artifact
  * ci, fuzz: the protocol, ABI and fuzz jobs name their cell
  * ci, fuzz: the build, the protocol, the ABI and the fuzz jobs take their
